    "Same key + different payload is rejected, never applied"
   ],
   "title": "Commit-then-ACK"
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "items": [
    "ACK is not a delete permit: cleanup needs the horizon",
    "Past the horizon a replay looks brand new and re-applies",
    "External sends are at-least-once: idempotent receivers required"
   ],
   "title": "Horizon bounds the promise"
  }
